## ✅ **Modal Verbs – Questions with Answers**

---

### 🔹 **1. Fill in the Blanks**

1. You \_\_\_ obey your parents.
   👉 **must** ✅
   (Obligation)

2. She \_\_\_ sing well when she was young.
   👉 **could** ✅
   (Past ability)

3. We \_\_\_ finish the work today.
   👉 **must** ✅
   (Necessity)

4. \_\_\_ you please help me?
   👉 **Would** ✅
   (Polite request)

5. He \_\_\_ be at home. I saw him going there.
   👉 **must** ✅
   (Strong logical assumption)

6. You \_\_\_ not speak loudly in the library.
   👉 **should** ✅
   (Advice)

7. I \_\_\_ go to the market, but I am not sure.
   👉 **may** ✅
   (Possibility)

8. She said that she \_\_\_ come tomorrow.
   👉 **might** ✅
   (Less possibility, indirect speech)

9. We \_\_\_ always respect our elders.
   👉 **should** ✅
   (Moral duty)

10. He \_\_\_ have missed the bus.
    👉 **must** ✅
    (Strong possibility in the past)

